<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Raven</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7f6;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e2ebe6;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            color: #007a55;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #101b18;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .success-box {
            background: #f0f7f3;
            border: 1px solid #d5e8df;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            color: #007a55;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .credentials {
            background: #f8faf9;
            border: 1px solid #dfe9e4;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .credential-row {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .credential-row:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6b7280;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .value {
            display: block;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dfe9e4;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #111827;
            font-size: 14px;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .warning {
            background: #fff8e7;
            border: 1px solid #f1dfad;
            color: #795c16;
            padding: 13px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5eee9;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9aaa9f;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">

        <div class="logo">
            RAVEN
        </div>

        <h2>
            Congratulations, <%= name %>! 🎉
        </h2>

        <p>
            We're excited to inform you that you have been officially
            selected to join <strong>Raven</strong> as
            <strong>
                <%= position %>
            </strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="success-box">
            Welcome to the Raven team!
        </div>

        <p>
            Your application has been successfully reviewed, and we are
            pleased to welcome you to our team.
        </p>

        <p>
            Below are your temporary login credentials:
        </p>

        <div class="credentials">

            <div class="credential-row">
                <span class="label">Email</span>
                <span class="value">
                    <%= email %>
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="credential-row">
                <span class="label">Temporary Password</span>
                <span class="value">
                    <%= temporaryPassword %>
                </span>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="warning">
            <strong>Important:</strong>
            This is a temporary password. Please log in using these
            credentials and change your password immediately after your
            first login.
        </div>

        <p>
            We look forward to working with you, building meaningful
            products, and creating something remarkable together.
        </p>

        <p>
            Further information about your onboarding and next steps
            will be shared with you soon.
        </p>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Raven. All rights reserved.
                <br />
                See what's next. Build what matters.
        </div>

    </div>
</body>

</html>